From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH app-loader 001] android: export ICD symbols alongside HMI

Purpose: Make the Android/Bionic libvulkan_panfrost.so hot-loadable inside
 an ordinary application process (Samba S3, loader-test APK, Winlator /
 AdrenoTools-style loaders): export vk_icdGetInstanceProcAddr,
 vk_icdGetPhysicalDeviceProcAddr and
 vk_icdNegotiateLoaderICDInterfaceVersion IN ADDITION to HMI, while
 keeping Android WSI + AHardwareBuffer interop. Without this, enabling
 Android WSI selects the HAL-only symbol scheme and hides the ICD entry
 points (the exact failure Gate A guards).
Source/Reference: plan sec.6.1 + G52 lesson; upstream files
 src/vulkan/vulkan-android.sym (HAL-only) and src/vulkan/meson.build.
 New file src/vulkan/vulkan-app-loader.sym rides in
 patches/app-loader/files/.
Tested GPU: none yet (Gate A static check after rebuild).
Tested Kbase UAPI: n/a.
Mesa base range: 26.3.0-devel (pinned 5a07217f).
Dependencies: none.
Validation test: scripts/validate-binary.sh --abi android asserts all
 three ICD exports visible and HMI still present.

diff --git a/src/vulkan/meson.build b/src/vulkan/meson.build
--- a/src/vulkan/meson.build
+++ b/src/vulkan/meson.build
@@ -9,8 +9,10 @@
 if with_platform_android
   vulkan_icd_symbols = files('vulkan-icd-android-symbols.txt')
   if with_ld_version_script
-    vulkan_icd_link_args += ['-Wl,--version-script', join_paths(meson.current_source_dir(), 'vulkan-android.sym')]
-    vulkan_icd_link_depends += files('vulkan-android.sym')
+    # panvk-kbase-android: application-loadable ICD (HMI + ICD symbols).
+    # New file; see patches/app-loader/files/src/vulkan/.
+    vulkan_icd_link_args += ['-Wl,--version-script', join_paths(meson.current_source_dir(), 'vulkan-app-loader.sym')]
+    vulkan_icd_link_depends += files('vulkan-app-loader.sym')
   endif
 else
   vulkan_icd_symbols = files('vulkan-icd-symbols.txt')
